  "Why does this distinction matter so much when working through Tier 3: Multi-Product Stigler Bundling & Two-Part Tariff Economics? Because in real-world engagements, small misconfigurations in Distribution or cybersecurity rarely announce themselves with an obvious crash; instead, they quietly skew modules until an independent reconciliation exposes the gap. By stepping through the logic of Threat methodically and confirming each intermediate threshold, you build a repeatable habit that holds up under executive and regulatory scrutiny.",
