  "Let us connect Tier 5: Milestone 3 Grand Master Command Center & Macroeconomic Stress Test directly to day-to-day practice: During the 2021-2022 global supply chain inflation, Procter & Gamble refused to engage in destructive retail discounting. Leveraging strong , the most important discipline is verifying the underlying assumptions before acting on the headline figure. Rising costs paired with discounted prices compress contribution margins from both directions, causing severe profit destruction, which is why experienced practitioners always document both the primary calculation and the boundary conditions surrounding refused and strong.",
