      "example": "Unilever exemplifies the transition from Polycentric to Geocentric architecture. For decades, Unilever operated autonomous subsidiaries in 80 countries, each marketing different shampoo brands with separate packaging and formulations. Under its 'One Unilever' transformation, it consolidated onto global core brand platforms (Dove, Rexona, Knorr), capturing \u20ac1 billion in procurement and manufacturing synergies while preserving localized fragrance and sizing adjustments.",
      "code": "# Simulation: EPRG Strategic Orientation Evaluator & Organizational Efficiency Engine\ndef audit_eprg_organizational_orientation(\n    headquarters_centralization_pct: float, # 100% = Pure HQ control, 0% = Total Subsidiary Autonomy\n    product_standardization_pct: float,      # 100% = Zero adaptation, 0% = Bespoke local product\n    cross_border_overhead_duplication_usd: float,\n    global_manufacturing_economies_usd: float,\n    local_cultural_responsiveness_score: float # 1.0 to 10.0\n) -> dict:\n    # Determine EPRG Classification\n    if headquarters_centralization_pct >= 80.0 and product_standardization_pct >= 80.0:\n        orientation = 'ETHNOCENTRIC_HOME_BIAS'\n        risk_profile = 'Severe cultural blindness risk; high probability of host-market rejection.'\n    elif headquarters_centralization_pct <= 25.0 and product_standardization_pct <= 30.0:\n        orientation = 'POLYCENTRIC_HOST_BIAS'\n        risk_profile = 'Excessive cost duplication; complete loss of global purchasing economies.'\n    elif 40.0 <= headquarters_centralization_pct <= 70.0 and 50.0 <= product_standardization_pct <= 75.0:\n        orientation = 'GEOCENTRIC_GLOCAL_SYNTHESIS'\n        risk_profile = 'Optimal equilibrium; captures global scale while ensuring local cultural fit.'\n    else:\n        orientation = 'REGIOCENTRIC_REGIONAL_BLOC'\n        risk_profile = 'Moderate regional scale; bounded by trade bloc borders.'\n\n    # Calculate Net Strategic Value\n    net_economic_scale_value = global_manufacturing_economies_usd - cross_border_overhead_duplication_usd\n\n    return {\n        'eprg_classification': orientation,\n        'risk_profile_diagnosis': risk_profile,\n        'net_economic_scale_value_usd': net_economic_scale_value,\n        'local_responsiveness_score': local_cultural_responsiveness_score,\n        'strategic_health': 'SUPERIOR_GLOCAL_PLATFORM' if orientation == 'GEOCENTRIC_GLOCAL_SYNTHESIS' and net_economic_scale_value > 0 else 'ORGANIZATIONAL_ALIGNMENT_NEEDED'\n    }\n\nethno_case = audit_eprg_organizational_orientation(90.0, 95.0, 2000000.0, 15000000.0, 3.2)\npoly_case = audit_eprg_organizational_orientation(15.0, 20.0, 18000000.0, 2000000.0, 9.2)\ngeoc_case = audit_eprg_organizational_orientation(55.0, 68.0, 4000000.0, 16000000.0, 8.5)\n\nprint(f\"Scenario 1: [{ethno_case['eprg_classification']}] -> Cultural Fit: {ethno_case['local_responsiveness_score']}/10.0 | Net Scale: ${ethno_case['net_economic_scale_value_usd']:,}\")\nprint(f\"  Risk: {ethno_case['risk_profile_diagnosis']}\")\nprint(f\"Scenario 2: [{poly_case['eprg_classification']}] -> Cultural Fit: {poly_case['local_responsiveness_score']}/10.0 | Net Scale: ${poly_case['net_economic_scale_value_usd']:,}\")\nprint(f\"  Risk: {poly_case['risk_profile_diagnosis']}\")\nprint(f\"Scenario 3: [{geoc_case['eprg_classification']}] -> Cultural Fit: {geoc_case['local_responsiveness_score']}/10.0 | Net Scale: ${geoc_case['net_economic_scale_value_usd']:,}\")\nprint(f\"  Status: [{geoc_case['strategic_health']}]\")\n",
      "output": "Scenario 1: [ETHNOCENTRIC_HOME_BIAS] -> Cultural Fit: 3.2/10.0 | Net Scale: $13,000,000.0\n  Risk: Severe cultural blindness risk; high probability of host-market rejection.\nScenario 2: [POLYCENTRIC_HOST_BIAS] -> Cultural Fit: 9.2/10.0 | Net Scale: $-16,000,000.0\n  Risk: Excessive cost duplication; complete loss of global purchasing economies.\nScenario 3: [GEOCENTRIC_GLOCAL_SYNTHESIS] -> Cultural Fit: 8.5/10.0 | Net Scale: $12,000,000.0\n  Status: [SUPERIOR_GLOCAL_PLATFORM]",
