      "example": "IKEA strictly followed the Uppsala incremental model: expanding first into neighbouring Norway (1963) and Denmark (1969), learning supply chain mechanics over a decade before entering Switzerland (1973), Germany (1974), and eventually the United States (1985). Conversely, Spotify launched in Sweden and expanded simultaneously across Europe and the US within months as a classic Born Global digital platform.",
      "code": "# Simulation: Uppsala Incremental Learning Timeline vs Born Global Digital Velocity\ndef simulate_internationalization_velocity(\n    is_digital_native_product: bool,\n    psychic_distance_index: float, # 1.0 (Low/Neighbors) to 10.0 (High/Distant)\n    accumulated_foreign_experience_years: float\n) -> dict:\n    if is_digital_native_product:\n        # Born Global dynamics: Friction is minimal; rapid global scaling\n        expansion_model = 'BORN_GLOBAL_ACCELERATOR'\n        months_to_global_presence = 6.0 + (psychic_distance_index * 1.5)\n        resource_drag = 'Low (Zero Physical Logistics Inventory)'\n        learning_barrier_factor = 0.2\n    else:\n        # Uppsala model: Progressively slowed by psychic distance and lack of experience\n        expansion_model = 'UPPSALA_INCREMENTAL_ESTABLISHMENT_CHAIN'\n        experience_mitigation = min(0.8, accumulated_foreign_experience_years * 0.08)\n        effective_psychic_barrier = max(1.0, psychic_distance_index * (1.0 - experience_mitigation))\n        months_to_global_presence = effective_psychic_barrier * 18.0 # Multi-year progression\n        resource_drag = 'High (Warehousing, Regulatory Testing & Local Supply Chains)'\n        learning_barrier_factor = round(effective_psychic_barrier, 2)\n\n    return {\n        'product_type': 'Digital SaaS / API' if is_digital_native_product else 'Physical Industrial / CPG',\n        'prescribed_model': expansion_model,\n        'projected_time_to_scale_months': round(months_to_global_presence, 1),\n        'psychic_distance_learning_drag': learning_barrier_factor,\n        'operational_resource_drag': resource_drag\n    }\n\nphysical_cpg = simulate_internationalization_velocity(False, 8.5, accumulated_foreign_experience_years=2.0)\ndigital_saas = simulate_internationalization_velocity(True, 8.5, accumulated_foreign_experience_years=0.5)\n\nprint(f\"Physical CPG Product -> Model: [{physical_cpg['prescribed_model']}]\")\nprint(f\"  Time to Global Presence: {physical_cpg['projected_time_to_scale_months']} Months ({round(physical_cpg['projected_time_to_scale_months']/12, 1)} Years) | Drag: {physical_cpg['operational_resource_drag']}\")\nprint(f\"Digital SaaS Platform -> Model: [{digital_saas['prescribed_model']}]\")\nprint(f\"  Time to Global Presence: {digital_saas['projected_time_to_scale_months']} Months ({round(digital_saas['projected_time_to_scale_months']/12, 1)} Years) | Drag: {digital_saas['operational_resource_drag']}\")\n",
      "output": "Physical CPG Product -> Model: [UPPSALA_INCREMENTAL_ESTABLISHMENT_CHAIN]\n  Time to Global Presence: 128.5 Months (10.7 Years) | Drag: High (Warehousing, Regulatory Testing & Local Supply Chains)\nDigital SaaS Platform -> Model: [BORN_GLOBAL_ACCELERATOR]\n  Time to Global Presence: 18.8 Months (1.6 Years) | Drag: Low (Zero Physical Logistics Inventory)",
