      "example": "Apple's entry into India: When India maintained strict 30% local sourcing mandates for single-brand retail, Apple could not open wholly-owned Apple Stores. Apple initially entered via Third-Party Premium Resellers (Contractual Export). Once local manufacturing partners (Foxconn, Pegatron) expanded assembly in India satisfying local sourcing rules, Apple transitioned to Wholly-Owned Flagship Stores in Mumbai and Delhi, controlling the entire customer experience.",
      "code": "# Simulation: Algorithmic Cross-Border Entry Mode Decision Engine\ndef select_optimal_international_entry_mode(\n    country_name: str,\n    annual_market_revenue_potential_usd: float,\n    political_risk_score: float, # 1.0 (Safe) to 10.0 (High Risk)\n    mandatory_local_ownership_law: bool,\n    proprietary_ip_sensitivity: float, # 1.0 (Commodity) to 10.0 (Core Crown Jewels)\n    corporate_capital_budget_usd: float\n) -> dict:\n    # Rule 1: Legal constraints\n    if mandatory_local_ownership_law:\n        if corporate_capital_budget_usd >= 2000000.0:\n            recommended_mode = 'EQUITY_INTERNATIONAL_JOINT_VENTURE (50/50 or Minority Local Partner)'\n            rationalization = 'Mandatory local ownership laws disqualify Wholly-Owned FDI; capital supports an equity joint venture.'\n        else:\n            recommended_mode = 'INTERNATIONAL_LICENSING_OR_FRANCHISING'\n            rationalization = 'Ownership restrictions paired with capital limits mandate contractual licensing.'\n    else:\n        # Rule 2: IP Protection vs Capital Scale\n        if proprietary_ip_sensitivity >= 8.0:\n            # High IP sensitivity strictly forbids licensing (too risky)\n            if corporate_capital_budget_usd >= 5000000.0 and political_risk_score <= 5.0 and annual_market_revenue_potential_usd >= 20000000.0:\n                recommended_mode = 'WHOLLY_OWNED_FOREIGN_SUBSIDIARY (FDI / Greenfield or Acquisition)'\n                rationalization = 'Massive revenue potential, manageable risk, and high IP sensitivity justify 100% equity ownership.'\n            elif corporate_capital_budget_usd >= 2000000.0:\n                recommended_mode = 'DIRECT_EXPORTING_WITH_OWNED_SALES_OFFICE'\n                rationalization = 'High IP sensitivity prevents licensing; export distribution protects technology while limiting capital.'\n            else:\n                recommended_mode = 'DIRECT_CROSS_BORDER_DIGITAL_EXPORTING'\n                rationalization = 'Capital constraints require remote digital export to preserve intellectual property.'\n        else:\n            # Moderate/Low IP sensitivity allows flexible modes\n            if corporate_capital_budget_usd < 1000000.0:\n                recommended_mode = 'INDIRECT_OR_DIRECT_EXPORTING'\n                rationalization = 'Capital preservation posture; lowest risk entry mode.'\n            elif political_risk_score >= 7.0:\n                recommended_mode = 'INTERNATIONAL_LICENSING'\n                rationalization = 'High political/sovereign risk dictates asset-light licensing to transfer operational risk to local licensee.'\n            else:\n                recommended_mode = 'STRATEGIC_EQUITY_ALLIANCE_OR_JOINT_VENTURE'\n                rationalization = 'Balanced risk and capital sharing in an open market environment.'\n\n    return {\n        'target_country': country_name,\n        'recommended_entry_mode': recommended_mode,\n        'strategic_rationalization': rationalization\n    }\n\ncase_germany = select_optimal_international_entry_mode('Germany', 45000000.0, 2.0, False, 9.2, 12000000.0)\ncase_india_prior = select_optimal_international_entry_mode('India_Legacy_Retail', 35000000.0, 4.5, True, 7.5, 8000000.0)\ncase_nigeria = select_optimal_international_entry_mode('Nigeria', 15000000.0, 7.5, False, 4.0, 800000.0)\n\nprint(f\"Market: {case_germany['target_country']}\")\nprint(f\"  Decision: [{case_germany['recommended_entry_mode']}]\")\nprint(f\"  Rationale: {case_germany['strategic_rationalization']}\")\nprint(f\"Market: {case_india_prior['target_country']}\")\nprint(f\"  Decision: [{case_india_prior['recommended_entry_mode']}]\")\nprint(f\"Market: {case_nigeria['target_country']}\")\nprint(f\"  Decision: [{case_nigeria['recommended_entry_mode']}]\")\n",
      "output": "Market: Germany\n  Decision: [WHOLLY_OWNED_FOREIGN_SUBSIDIARY (FDI / Greenfield or Acquisition)]\n  Rationale: Massive revenue potential, manageable risk, and high IP sensitivity justify 100% equity ownership.\nMarket: India_Legacy_Retail\n  Decision: [EQUITY_INTERNATIONAL_JOINT_VENTURE (50/50 or Minority Local Partner)]\nMarket: Nigeria\n  Decision: [INDIRECT_OR_DIRECT_EXPORTING]",
