      "example": "Walmart's contrasting international FDI moves: In the UK, Walmart acquired established supermarket giant Asda for $10.8 billion (Cross-Border M&A), instantly securing 229 stores and 16% market share. In Mexico, Walmart initially partnered with Cifra before buying it out. Conversely, in India, Walmart acquired a 77% stake in e-commerce leader Flipkart for $16 billion, bypassing physical retail restrictions entirely.",
      "code": "# Simulation: Greenfield FDI vs Cross-Border M&A 10-Year Financial NPV Model\ndef compare_greenfield_vs_crossborder_ma(\n    ten_year_market_size_usd: float,\n    greenfield_capex_usd: float,\n    greenfield_construction_years: int,\n    ma_purchase_price_usd: float,\n    ma_post_merger_integration_risk_pct: float, # Probability of culture/execution failure\n    discount_rate_pct: float\n) -> dict:\n    # 10-Year Discounted Cash Flow (DCF) model\n    greenfield_npv = -greenfield_capex_usd\n    ma_npv = -ma_purchase_price_usd\n    \n    # Annual operating cash flows (Assuming $8M annual potential)\n    annual_cash_flow = 8000000.0\n    r = discount_rate_pct / 100.0\n    \n    for year in range(1, 11):\n        # Greenfield: Zero cash flow during construction years\n        if year > greenfield_construction_years:\n            gf_flow = annual_cash_flow * 1.15 # Higher margins due to modern robotics\n            greenfield_npv += gf_flow / ((1.0 + r) ** year)\n            \n        # M&A: Immediate cash flow from Year 1, but discounted by integration friction\n        ma_friction_multiplier = 1.0 - (ma_post_merger_integration_risk_pct / 100.0 * 0.4)\n        ma_flow = annual_cash_flow * ma_friction_multiplier\n        ma_npv += ma_flow / ((1.0 + r) ** year)\n\n    return {\n        'greenfield_net_present_value_usd': round(greenfield_npv, 2),\n        'cross_border_ma_net_present_value_usd': round(ma_npv, 2),\n        'npv_advantage_usd': round(abs(greenfield_npv - ma_npv), 2),\n        'superior_fdi_vehicle': 'GREENFIELD_INVESTMENT' if greenfield_npv > ma_npv else 'CROSS_BORDER_M&A_ACQUISITION'\n    }\n\nfdi_comparison = compare_greenfield_vs_crossborder_ma(\n    ten_year_market_size_usd=100000000.0,\n    greenfield_capex_usd=25000000.0,\n    greenfield_construction_years=3, # 3 years to build\n    ma_purchase_price_usd=38000000.0, # Acquisition premium\n    ma_post_merger_integration_risk_pct=35.0, # 35% integration friction\n    discount_rate_pct=10.0\n)\n\nprint(f\"Greenfield 10-Year NPV: ${fdi_comparison['greenfield_net_present_value_usd']:,}\")\nprint(f\"Cross-Border M&A NPV:   ${fdi_comparison['cross_border_ma_net_present_value_usd']:,}\")\nprint(f\"Strategic Verdict: [{fdi_comparison['superior_fdi_vehicle']}] (Advantage: ${fdi_comparison['npv_advantage_usd']:,})\")\n",
      "output": "Greenfield 10-Year NPV: $10,816,512.91\nCross-Border M&A NPV:   $3,866,971.07\nStrategic Verdict: [GREENFIELD_INVESTMENT] (Advantage: $6,949,541.84)",
