      "example": "De Beers' brilliant execution of Strategy 3 (Product Extension, Communication Adaptation): When entering Japan in the late 1960s, less than 5% of Japanese brides received a diamond engagement ring. By adapting the promotional narrative to align with Japan's post-war modernization ethos\u2014positioning diamonds as the sophisticated choice of the modern Westernized Japanese woman\u2014diamond engagement adoption surged to over 60% within a decade, without altering the physical diamond product.",
      "code": "# Simulation: Warren Keegan's 5-Strategy Global Product-Promotion Decision Engine\ndef select_keegan_global_strategy(\n    target_country: str,\n    requires_physical_product_adaptation: bool,\n    cultural_use_case_differs: bool,\n    requires_bottom_of_pyramid_invention: bool\n) -> dict:\n    if requires_bottom_of_pyramid_invention:\n        strategy_code = 'STRATEGY_5_PRODUCT_INVENTION'\n        description = 'Develop a completely new, purpose-built product tailored to local infrastructure and purchasing power.'\n        capex_profile = 'High R&D, low unit cost manufacturing'\n    elif not requires_physical_product_adaptation and not cultural_use_case_differs:\n        strategy_code = 'STRATEGY_1_DUAL_EXTENSION'\n        description = 'Straight Extension: Market the identical product using the identical global advertising campaign.'\n        capex_profile = 'Lowest cost; zero incremental R&D or advertising production'\n    elif requires_physical_product_adaptation and not cultural_use_case_differs:\n        strategy_code = 'STRATEGY_2_PRODUCT_ADAPTATION_COMMUNICATION_EXTENSION'\n        description = 'Modify product for local voltages, climate, or regulations while maintaining unified global positioning.'\n        capex_profile = 'Moderate product engineering capex, low marketing creative capex'\n    elif not requires_physical_product_adaptation and cultural_use_case_differs:\n        strategy_code = 'STRATEGY_3_PRODUCT_EXTENSION_COMMUNICATION_ADAPTATION'\n        description = 'Preserve identical physical product while crafting bespoke local cultural advertising narratives.'\n        capex_profile = 'Zero product engineering capex, moderate marketing creative capex'\n    else:\n        strategy_code = 'STRATEGY_4_DUAL_ADAPTATION'\n        description = 'Dual Adaptation: Reformulate physical product and author localized advertising campaigns.'\n        capex_profile = 'High combined product engineering and localized marketing investment'\n\n    return {\n        'country': target_country,\n        'keegan_strategy': strategy_code,\n        'strategic_blueprint': description,\n        'capital_profile': capex_profile\n    }\n\nstrat_rolex = select_keegan_global_strategy('Switzerland_Global_Luxury', False, False, False)\nstrat_debeers = select_keegan_global_strategy('Japan_Diamond_Campaign', False, True, False)\nstrat_shampoo = select_keegan_global_strategy('Indonesia_Tropical_Care', True, True, False)\n\nprint(f\"Rolex Luxury Strategy:    [{strat_rolex['keegan_strategy']}] -> {strat_rolex['strategic_blueprint']}\")\nprint(f\"De Beers Japan Strategy:  [{strat_debeers['keegan_strategy']}] -> {strat_debeers['strategic_blueprint']}\")\nprint(f\"Tropical Care Strategy:   [{strat_shampoo['keegan_strategy']}] -> {strat_shampoo['strategic_blueprint']}\")\n",
      "output": "Rolex Luxury Strategy:    [STRATEGY_1_DUAL_EXTENSION] -> Straight Extension: Market the identical product using the identical global advertising campaign.\nDe Beers Japan Strategy:  [STRATEGY_3_PRODUCT_EXTENSION_COMMUNICATION_ADAPTATION] -> Preserve identical physical product while crafting bespoke local cultural advertising narratives.\nTropical Care Strategy:   [STRATEGY_4_DUAL_ADAPTATION] -> Dual Adaptation: Reformulate physical product and author localized advertising campaigns.",
