      "example": "American craft beer exporting to Japan: A six-pack that retails for $11.99 in California experiences multi-tier price escalation across refrigerated ocean reefer containers, Japanese customs import duties, liquor distributor margins, and Tokyo luxury department store markups, ending up with an eye-watering retail price tag of \u00a54,200 ($28.00), transforming an everyday beverage into an elite luxury delicacy.",
      "code": "# Simulation: 10-Layer International Price Escalation Cost Stack Engine\ndef calculate_price_escalation_stack(\n    factory_exw_unit_cost_usd: float,\n    special_export_packaging_usd: float,\n    domestic_inland_freight_usd: float,\n    ocean_freight_and_marine_insurance_usd: float,\n    import_customs_tariff_pct: float,\n    foreign_port_customs_fees_usd: float,\n    importer_distributor_markup_pct: float,\n    foreign_retailer_markup_pct: float,\n    host_country_vat_tax_pct: float\n) -> dict:\n    # Step 1: CIF Value\n    cif_landed_base = (\n        factory_exw_unit_cost_usd +\n        special_export_packaging_usd +\n        domestic_inland_freight_usd +\n        ocean_freight_and_marine_insurance_usd\n    )\n    \n    # Step 2: Customs Tariff applied on CIF\n    customs_tariff_usd = cif_landed_base * (import_customs_tariff_pct / 100.0)\n    landed_duty_paid_cost = cif_landed_base + customs_tariff_usd + foreign_port_customs_fees_usd\n    \n    # Step 3: Importer Wholesale Price\n    wholesale_price_to_retailer = landed_duty_paid_cost * (1.0 + (importer_distributor_markup_pct / 100.0))\n    \n    # Step 4: Final Consumer Retail Shelf Price (Before and After VAT)\n    retail_price_before_vat = wholesale_price_to_retailer * (1.0 + (foreign_retailer_markup_pct / 100.0))\n    final_shelf_price_with_vat = retail_price_before_vat * (1.0 + (host_country_vat_tax_pct / 100.0))\n    \n    price_escalation_multiplier = final_shelf_price_with_vat / factory_exw_unit_cost_usd\n\n    return {\n        'factory_exw_cost_usd': factory_exw_unit_cost_usd,\n        'cif_value_usd': round(cif_landed_base, 2),\n        'customs_tariff_duty_usd': round(customs_tariff_usd, 2),\n        'landed_cost_usd': round(landed_duty_paid_cost, 2),\n        'wholesale_price_usd': round(wholesale_price_to_retailer, 2),\n        'retail_shelf_price_usd': round(final_shelf_price_with_vat, 2),\n        'escalation_multiplier': round(price_escalation_multiplier, 2),\n        'total_inflation_pct': round((price_escalation_multiplier - 1.0) * 100, 1)\n    }\n\nbeer_export = calculate_price_escalation_stack(\n    factory_exw_unit_cost_usd=6.50, # $6.50 six-pack factory cost\n    special_export_packaging_usd=0.80,\n    domestic_inland_freight_usd=0.70,\n    ocean_freight_and_marine_insurance_usd=2.50,\n    import_customs_tariff_pct=15.0,\n    foreign_port_customs_fees_usd=0.50,\n    importer_distributor_markup_pct=30.0,\n    foreign_retailer_markup_pct=40.0,\n    host_country_vat_tax_pct=10.0\n)\n\nprint(f\"Factory EXW Unit Cost: ${beer_export['factory_exw_cost_usd']}\")\nprint(f\"CIF Ocean Landed Base: ${beer_export['cif_value_usd']} | Tariff Duty: ${beer_export['customs_tariff_duty_usd']}\")\nprint(f\"Wholesale to Dealer:   ${beer_export['wholesale_price_usd']}\")\nprint(f\"Final Foreign Shelf Price (with VAT): ${beer_export['retail_shelf_price_usd']} ({beer_export['escalation_multiplier']}x Escalation! +{beer_export['total_inflation_pct']}% Inflation)\")\n",
      "output": "Factory EXW Unit Cost: $6.5\nCIF Ocean Landed Base: $10.5 | Tariff Duty: $1.58\nWholesale to Dealer:   $16.35\nFinal Foreign Shelf Price (with VAT): $25.18 (3.87x Escalation! +287.4% Inflation)",
