      "example": "The European Union's landmark anti-dumping duties on Chinese solar panel manufacturers in the 2010s. European regulators determined that Chinese solar panel producers, backed by subsidized state loans and cheap land, were exporting panels to Europe below production costs, bankrupting German and Spanish solar manufacturers. The EU threatened tariffs of up to 47.6%, prompting negotiations and price floors.",
      "code": "# Simulation: WTO Anti-Dumping Audit & Punitive Tariff Margin Calculator\ndef audit_wto_dumping_exposure(\n    home_market_normal_value_usd: float,\n    export_selling_price_fob_usd: float,\n    domestic_industry_lost_market_share_pct: float,\n    annual_dumped_import_units: int\n) -> dict:\n    # Step 1: Calculate Dumping Margin\n    # Dumping Margin = (Normal Value - Export Price) / Export Price\n    price_difference = home_market_normal_value_usd - export_selling_price_fob_usd\n    \n    if price_difference > 0:\n        is_dumping_present = True\n        dumping_margin_pct = (price_difference / export_selling_price_fob_usd) * 100.0\n    else:\n        is_dumping_present = False\n        dumping_margin_pct = 0.0\n\n    # Step 2: Material Injury Threshold (WTO benchmark: >3% market share loss)\n    material_injury_proven = domestic_industry_lost_market_share_pct >= 3.0\n    \n    # Step 3: Legal Tariff Remedy\n    if is_dumping_present and material_injury_proven:\n        regulatory_remedy = 'PUNITIVE_ANTI_DUMPING_DUTY_APPLIED'\n        punitive_tariff_rate_pct = round(dumping_margin_pct, 1)\n        projected_tariff_liability_usd = annual_dumped_import_units * price_difference\n    elif is_dumping_present and not material_injury_proven:\n        regulatory_remedy = 'DUMPING_DETECTED_BUT_NO_MATERIAL_INJURY (De Minimis / Monitor)'\n        punitive_tariff_rate_pct = 0.0\n        projected_tariff_liability_usd = 0.0\n    else:\n        regulatory_remedy = 'NO_DUMPING_COMPLIANT_FAIR_TRADE'\n        punitive_tariff_rate_pct = 0.0\n        projected_tariff_liability_usd = 0.0\n\n    return {\n        'home_normal_value_usd': home_market_normal_value_usd,\n        'export_price_usd': export_selling_price_fob_usd,\n        'dumping_margin_pct': round(dumping_margin_pct, 1),\n        'material_injury_proven': material_injury_proven,\n        'remedy_status': regulatory_remedy,\n        'punitive_tariff_rate_pct': punitive_tariff_rate_pct,\n        'projected_tariff_liability_usd': round(projected_tariff_liability_usd, 2)\n    }\n\npredatory_steel = audit_wto_dumping_exposure(120.0, 75.0, 8.5, 500000)\ncompliant_pharma = audit_wto_dumping_exposure(100.0, 105.0, 1.2, 200000)\n\nprint(f\"Steel Case: Normal Value = ${predatory_steel['home_normal_value_usd']} vs Export = ${predatory_steel['export_price_usd']}\")\nprint(f\"  Dumping Margin: {predatory_steel['dumping_margin_pct']}% | Injury Proven: {predatory_steel['material_injury_proven']}\")\nprint(f\"  Verdict: [{predatory_steel['remedy_status']}] -> Anti-Dumping Duty: {predatory_steel['punitive_tariff_rate_pct']}% (Liability: ${predatory_steel['projected_tariff_liability_usd']:,})\")\nprint(f\"Pharma Case: Verdict = [{compliant_pharma['remedy_status']}]\")\n",
      "output": "Steel Case: Normal Value = $120.0 vs Export = $75.0\n  Dumping Margin: 60.0% | Injury Proven: True\n  Verdict: [PUNITIVE_ANTI_DUMPING_DUTY_APPLIED] -> Anti-Dumping Duty: 60.0% (Liability: $22,500,000.0)\nPharma Case: Verdict = [NO_DUMPING_COMPLIANT_FAIR_TRADE]",
      "tryIt": "Increase export_selling_price_fob_usd in the steel case to $120.0 (fair value pricing) and observe how the punitive duty collapses to zero.",
