      "example": "Porsche's legendary foreign exchange hedging strategy: Porsche manufactures almost all its sports cars in Germany (incurring costs in Euros) but sells a massive proportion of vehicles in North America (earning US Dollars). To prevent a weakening US dollar from devastating corporate earnings, Porsche systematically hedges 100% of its projected dollar revenues using forward contracts and currency options years in advance, protecting operating margins.",
      "code": "# Simulation: Cross-Border FX Exposure & Hedging Performance Engine (Forward vs Option)\ndef simulate_foreign_exchange_hedging_strategies(\n    contract_value_euros: float,\n    spot_rate_at_booking_usd_per_eur: float, # e.g. $1.10 / EUR\n    forward_contract_rate_usd_per_eur: float,# e.g. $1.09 / EUR\n    option_strike_price_usd_per_eur: float,  # e.g. $1.08 / EUR\n    option_premium_cost_pct: float,          # e.g. 2.0% ($0.02 / EUR)\n    spot_rate_at_settlement_usd_per_eur: float # Realized rate at Day 90\n) -> dict:\n    # Expected baseline revenue at booking spot rate\n    baseline_booking_revenue_usd = contract_value_euros * spot_rate_at_booking_usd_per_eur\n    \n    # Strategy 1: Unhedged Strategy (Full market volatility exposure)\n    unhedged_revenue_usd = contract_value_euros * spot_rate_at_settlement_usd_per_eur\n    unhedged_variance_usd = unhedged_revenue_usd - baseline_booking_revenue_usd\n\n    # Strategy 2: Forward Contract Hedge (Locked in rate)\n    forward_revenue_usd = contract_value_euros * forward_contract_rate_usd_per_eur\n    forward_variance_usd = forward_revenue_usd - baseline_booking_revenue_usd\n\n    # Strategy 3: Currency Option Hedge (Asymmetric downside cap)\n    option_premium_usd = contract_value_euros * spot_rate_at_booking_usd_per_eur * (option_premium_cost_pct / 100.0)\n    if spot_rate_at_settlement_usd_per_eur < option_strike_price_usd_per_eur:\n        # Exercise option at strike price\n        option_revenue_usd = (contract_value_euros * option_strike_price_usd_per_eur) - option_premium_usd\n    else:\n        # Let option expire, sell at higher market spot rate\n        option_revenue_usd = (contract_value_euros * spot_rate_at_settlement_usd_per_eur) - option_premium_usd\n    option_variance_usd = option_revenue_usd - baseline_booking_revenue_usd\n\n    return {\n        'contract_euros': contract_value_euros,\n        'booking_baseline_usd': baseline_booking_revenue_usd,\n        'realized_settlement_spot': spot_rate_at_settlement_usd_per_eur,\n        'unhedged_realized_usd': round(unhedged_revenue_usd, 2),\n        'unhedged_variance_usd': round(unhedged_variance_usd, 2),\n        'forward_hedge_realized_usd': round(forward_revenue_usd, 2),\n        'forward_hedge_variance_usd': round(forward_variance_usd, 2),\n        'option_hedge_realized_usd': round(option_revenue_usd, 2),\n        'option_hedge_variance_usd': round(option_variance_usd, 2)\n    }\n\n# Scenario: \u20ac10,000,000 contract booked at $1.10. At settlement, Euro collapses to $0.95 (-13.6% crash)\ncrash_audit = simulate_foreign_exchange_hedging_strategies(\n    contract_value_euros=10000000.0,\n    spot_rate_at_booking_usd_per_eur=1.10,\n    forward_contract_rate_usd_per_eur=1.09,\n    option_strike_price_usd_per_eur=1.08,\n    option_premium_cost_pct=2.0,\n    spot_rate_at_settlement_usd_per_eur=0.95\n)\n\nprint(f\"Contract: \u20ac{crash_audit['contract_euros']:,} | Booking Value: ${crash_audit['booking_baseline_usd']:,}\")\nprint(f\"Settlement Spot: ${crash_audit['realized_settlement_spot']} / EUR (Currency Crash!)\")\nprint(f\"  Unhedged Outcome:     ${crash_audit['unhedged_realized_usd']:,} (Catastrophic Loss: ${crash_audit['unhedged_variance_usd']:,})\")\nprint(f\"  Forward Hedge:        ${crash_audit['forward_hedge_realized_usd']:,} (Protected Cash: ${crash_audit['forward_hedge_variance_usd']:,})\")\nprint(f\"  Currency Option Hedge: ${crash_audit['option_hedge_realized_usd']:,} (Downside Capped: ${crash_audit['option_hedge_variance_usd']:,})\")\n",
      "output": "Contract: \u20ac10,000,000.0 | Booking Value: $11,000,000.0\nSettlement Spot: $0.95 / EUR (Currency Crash!)\n  Unhedged Outcome:     $9,500,000.0 (Catastrophic Loss: $-1,500,000.0)\n  Forward Hedge:        $10,900,000.0 (Protected Cash: $-100,000.0)\n  Currency Option Hedge: $10,580,000.0 (Downside Capped: $-420,000.0)",
      "tryIt": "Set spot_rate_at_settlement_usd_per_eur to $1.25 (Euro rally) and observe how the Currency Option captures $12,280,000 while the Forward remains locked at $10,900,000.",
