      "example": "Apple's global supply chain logistics orchestration: Apple books chartered Boeing 777 cargo freighters directly from assembly plants in Zhengzhou and Shenzhen to international distribution hubs ahead of new iPhone launches, bypassing maritime shipping entirely. By utilizing bonded customs corridors, Apple clears millions of iPhones through international customs in hours, coordinating global retail availability on a single worldwide launch day.",
      "code": "# Simulation: Global Logistics Lead-Time, HS Tariff Optimization & Safety Stock Model\ndef calculate_cross_border_supply_chain_logistics(\n    monthly_demand_units: int,\n    maritime_ocean_transit_days: int,\n    customs_clearance_duration_days: int,\n    geopolitical_chokepoint_delay_risk_days: int,\n    hs_tariff_code_standard_rate_pct: float,\n    hs_tariff_code_engineered_rate_pct: float,\n    cif_unit_value_usd: float\n) -> dict:\n    # Step 1: Total lead time and safety stock calculation\n    base_lead_time_days = maritime_ocean_transit_days + customs_clearance_duration_days\n    total_buffered_lead_time_days = base_lead_time_days + geopolitical_chokepoint_delay_risk_days\n    \n    daily_consumption_rate = monthly_demand_units / 30.0\n    required_buffer_safety_stock_units = int(daily_consumption_rate * total_buffered_lead_time_days)\n    \n    # Step 2: Tariff savings through HS code engineering\n    standard_annual_tariff_usd = monthly_demand_units * 12 * cif_unit_value_usd * (hs_tariff_code_standard_rate_pct / 100.0)\n    engineered_annual_tariff_usd = monthly_demand_units * 12 * cif_unit_value_usd * (hs_tariff_code_engineered_rate_pct / 100.0)\n    annual_customs_savings_usd = standard_annual_tariff_usd - engineered_annual_tariff_usd\n\n    return {\n        'monthly_demand_units': monthly_demand_units,\n        'base_lead_time_days': base_lead_time_days,\n        'total_buffered_lead_time_days': total_buffered_lead_time_days,\n        'required_safety_stock_units': required_buffer_safety_stock_units,\n        'standard_tariff_usd': round(standard_annual_tariff_usd, 2),\n        'engineered_tariff_usd': round(engineered_annual_tariff_usd, 2),\n        'annual_tariff_savings_usd': round(annual_customs_savings_usd, 2)\n    }\n\nlogistics = calculate_cross_border_supply_chain_logistics(\n    monthly_demand_units=50000,\n    maritime_ocean_transit_days=28,\n    customs_clearance_duration_days=5,\n    geopolitical_chokepoint_delay_risk_days=14, # 14-day Red Sea / Panama risk\n    hs_tariff_code_standard_rate_pct=18.0,\n    hs_tariff_code_engineered_rate_pct=4.5, # Reclassified sub-assembly\n    cif_unit_value_usd=120.0\n)\n\nprint(f\"Logistics Lead Time: Base = {logistics['base_lead_time_days']} Days -> Buffered = {logistics['total_buffered_lead_time_days']} Days\")\nprint(f\"Required Regional Safety Stock: {logistics['required_safety_stock_units']:,} Units\")\nprint(f\"HS Code Optimization: Standard Tariff = ${logistics['standard_tariff_usd']:,} -> Engineered = ${logistics['engineered_tariff_usd']:,}\")\nprint(f\"Annual Customs Tax Savings: ${logistics['annual_tariff_savings_usd']:,}\")\n",
