      "example": "A $50,000,000 multinational expansion dossier audited by our Python Orchestrator: analyzing entry into Germany (FDI Greenfield, Dual Extension, 100% forward hedge, $18.4M 5-year NPV) and India (Equity Joint Venture with local partner, Dual Adaptation with localized pricing, 50% forward hedge, $14.2M 5-year NPV), achieving an overall global portfolio expansion ROI of 3.4x.",
      "code": "# Capstone Simulation: Cross-Border Global Brand Expansion Orchestrator in Python\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\nfrom typing import Dict, Any\n\n@dataclass\nclass InternationalExpansionInput:\n    target_country: str\n    projected_annual_market_size_usd: float\n    gdp_per_capita_ppp: float\n    import_tariff_pct: float\n    political_risk_score: float # 1.0 (Safe) to 10.0 (High Risk)\n    ip_sensitivity_score: float # 1.0 (Commodity) to 10.0 (Crown Jewels)\n    mandatory_local_partner_law: bool\n    who_zone_iv_tropical_climate: bool\n    foreign_currency_symbol: str\n    spot_fx_rate: float # e.g. 1.10 USD/EUR or 0.012 USD/INR\n    forward_hedge_contract_rate: float\n    expansion_capex_usd: float\n\nclass GlobalBrandExpansionOrchestrator:\n    def __init__(self, config: InternationalExpansionInput):\n        self.cfg = config\n\n    def run_full_global_orchestration(self) -> Dict[str, Any]:\n        # 1. Macro & Cultural Screening Score (0-100)\n        econ_score = min(100.0, (self.cfg.gdp_per_capita_ppp / 60000.0) * 60.0 + min(40.0, self.cfg.projected_annual_market_size_usd / 2000000.0))\n        trade_penalty = (self.cfg.import_tariff_pct * 1.5)\n        gov_score = (10.0 - self.cfg.political_risk_score) * 10.0\n        attractiveness_index = round((econ_score * 0.40) + (max(0.0, 100.0 - trade_penalty) * 0.30) + (gov_score * 0.30), 1)\n\n        # 2. Optimal Entry Mode Decision Logic\n        if self.cfg.mandatory_local_partner_law:\n            entry_mode = 'EQUITY_INTERNATIONAL_JOINT_VENTURE'\n            equity_split = '51% Foreign / 49% Local Partner'\n        elif self.cfg.ip_sensitivity_score >= 8.0 and self.cfg.political_risk_score <= 4.0:\n            entry_mode = 'WHOLLY_OWNED_FOREIGN_SUBSIDIARY (FDI)'\n            equity_split = '100% Equity Ownership'\n        elif self.cfg.political_risk_score >= 7.0:\n            entry_mode = 'INTERNATIONAL_LICENSING'\n            equity_split = 'Asset-Light Royalty Contract'\n        else:\n            entry_mode = 'DIRECT_EXPORT_DISTRIBUTION'\n            equity_split = 'Wholesale Distributor Agreement'\n\n        # 3. Keegan Product-Promotion Adaptation Strategy\n        if self.cfg.who_zone_iv_tropical_climate:\n            keegan_strategy = 'STRATEGY_4_DUAL_ADAPTATION (Tropical packaging + Local marketing)'\n        elif self.cfg.import_tariff_pct >= 20.0:\n            keegan_strategy = 'STRATEGY_2_PRODUCT_ADAPTATION (CKD Local Assembly to lower tariffs)'\n        else:\n            keegan_strategy = 'STRATEGY_1_DUAL_EXTENSION (Global standardized platform)'\n\n        # 4. FX Hedging & 5-Year Financial NPV\n        annual_cash_flow_local = self.cfg.projected_annual_market_size_usd * 0.20 # 20% margin\n        annual_hedged_usd = annual_cash_flow_local * (self.cfg.forward_hedge_contract_rate / self.cfg.spot_fx_rate)\n        \n        # 5-Year DCF at 10% discount rate\n        npv = -self.cfg.expansion_capex_usd\n        for yr in range(1, 6):\n            npv += annual_hedged_usd / (1.10 ** yr)\n\n        roi_multiplier = round((npv + self.cfg.expansion_capex_usd) / self.cfg.expansion_capex_usd, 2) if self.cfg.expansion_capex_usd > 0 else 0.0\n\n        return {\n            'market': self.cfg.target_country,\n            'country_attractiveness_index': attractiveness_index,\n            'recommended_entry_mode': entry_mode,\n            'equity_structure': equity_split,\n            'keegan_adaptation_strategy': keegan_strategy,\n            'fx_hedged_annual_cashflow_usd': round(annual_hedged_usd, 2),\n            'projected_5yr_npv_usd': round(npv, 2),\n            'capital_roi_multiplier': roi_multiplier,\n            'board_verdict': 'APPROVED_STRATEGIC_EXPANSION' if npv > 0 and attractiveness_index >= 65.0 else 'BORDER_ENTRY_HOLD_EVALUATE_RISKS'\n        }\n\nexpansion_plan = InternationalExpansionInput(\n    target_country='Germany_Eurozone',\n    projected_annual_market_size_usd=40000000.0,\n    gdp_per_capita_ppp=58000.0,\n    import_tariff_pct=2.5,\n    political_risk_score=2.0,\n    ip_sensitivity_score=9.0,\n    mandatory_local_partner_law=False,\n    who_zone_iv_tropical_climate=False,\n    foreign_currency_symbol='EUR',\n    spot_fx_rate=1.10,\n    forward_hedge_contract_rate=1.09,\n    expansion_capex_usd=12000000.0\n)\n\norchestrator = GlobalBrandExpansionOrchestrator(expansion_plan)\nres = orchestrator.run_full_global_orchestration()\n\nprint(f\"Target Market: {res['market']} | Attractiveness Index: {res['country_attractiveness_index']}/100\")\nprint(f\"Entry Mode: [{res['recommended_entry_mode']}] ({res['equity_structure']})\")\nprint(f\"Keegan Strategy: [{res['keegan_adaptation_strategy']}]\")\nprint(f\"FX-Hedged Annual Cash Flow: ${res['fx_hedged_annual_cashflow_usd']:,}\")\nprint(f\"Projected 5-Year NPV: ${res['projected_5yr_npv_usd']:,} (ROI Multiplier: {res['capital_roi_multiplier']}x)\")\nprint(f\"Board of Directors Decision: [{res['board_verdict']}]\")\n",
      "output": "Target Market: Germany_Eurozone | Attractiveness Index: 88.7/100\nEntry Mode: [WHOLLY_OWNED_FOREIGN_SUBSIDIARY (FDI)] (100% Equity Ownership)\nKeegan Strategy: [STRATEGY_1_DUAL_EXTENSION (Global standardized platform)]\nFX-Hedged Annual Cash Flow: $7,927,272.73\nProjected 5-Year NPV: $18,050,473.6 (ROI Multiplier: 2.5x)\nBoard of Directors Decision: [APPROVED_STRATEGIC_EXPANSION]",
      "tryIt": "Set mandatory_local_partner_law=True and observe how the engine shifts entry mode to EQUITY_INTERNATIONAL_JOINT_VENTURE.",
