      "example": "When luxury giant LVMH defended its global retail expansion strategy across Asia to institutional shareholders, CEO Bernard Arnault demonstrated that global brand consistency paired with strict price corridor enforcement preserved operating margins above 26% across all international subsidiaries, driving LVMH into Europe's most valuable public corporation.",
      "code": "# Simulation: Boardroom International Expansion Defense Scorecard & Hurdle Audit\ndef audit_boardroom_global_expansion_defense(\n    requested_expansion_capex_usd: float,\n    projected_5yr_npv_usd: float,\n    fx_hedging_coverage_pct: float,\n    has_oecd_transfer_pricing_file: bool,\n    has_anti_bribery_fcpa_compliance_audit: bool,\n    gray_market_arbitrage_gap_pct: float\n) -> dict:\n    # Hurdle benchmarks\n    npv_pass = projected_5yr_npv_usd > 0\n    hedging_pass = fx_hedging_coverage_pct >= 80.0\n    transfer_pricing_pass = has_oecd_transfer_pricing_file\n    fcpa_pass = has_anti_bribery_fcpa_compliance_audit\n    arbitrage_pass = gray_market_arbitrage_gap_pct <= 20.0\n    \n    hurdles_passed = sum([npv_pass, hedging_pass, transfer_pricing_pass, fcpa_pass, arbitrage_pass])\n    \n    if hurdles_passed == 5:\n        board_verdict = 'UNANIMOUS_BOARD_APPROVAL_GLOBAL_LAUNCH'\n    elif hurdles_passed >= 4:\n        board_verdict = 'CONDITIONAL_APPROVAL_WITH_MONITORING'\n    else:\n        board_verdict = 'EXPANSION_REJECTED_GOVERNANCE_DEFICIT'\n\n    return {\n        'expansion_capex_usd': requested_expansion_capex_usd,\n        'projected_5yr_npv_usd': projected_5yr_npv_usd,\n        'passed_hurdles_score': f\"{hurdles_passed}/5\",\n        'boardroom_decision': board_verdict\n    }\n\nboard_eval = audit_boardroom_global_expansion_defense(\n    requested_expansion_capex_usd=12000000.0,\n    projected_5yr_npv_usd=18050473.60,\n    fx_hedging_coverage_pct=100.0,\n    has_oecd_transfer_pricing_file=True,\n    has_anti_bribery_fcpa_compliance_audit=True,\n    gray_market_arbitrage_gap_pct=14.0\n)\n\nprint(f\"Requested Expansion Capex: ${board_eval['expansion_capex_usd']:,}\")\nprint(f\"Projected 5-Year NPV:      ${board_eval['projected_5yr_npv_usd']:,}\")\nprint(f\"Governance Hurdle Score:   {board_eval['passed_hurdles_score']}\")\nprint(f\"Board of Directors Verdict: [{board_eval['boardroom_decision']}]\")\n",
      "output": "Requested Expansion Capex: $12,000,000.0\nProjected 5-Year NPV:      $18,050,473.6\nGovernance Hurdle Score:   5/5\nBoard of Directors Verdict: [UNANIMOUS_BOARD_APPROVAL_GLOBAL_LAUNCH]",
