  "Before moving on from Interactive Simulator: Enterprise Customer Data Platform (CDP) Identity Graph & Attribution Engine to the concept check below, mentally trace what happens if the primary input to Platforms doubles or drops by half. Seeing how Cloud absorbs that shock—and how ingesting and events surface the resulting variance—gives you an intuitive feel for the model's sensitivity. That intuition will serve you both in hands-on troubleshooting and in high-stakes technical interviews.",
