      "example": "An enterprise SaaS platform redesigning its documentation and landing pages with Next.js Server-Side Rendering, dropping LCP from 3.8s to 1.4s, lifting organic indexed URLs by 94%, and increasing Google Ads Quality Score from 6 to 9, saving $42,000 monthly in paid media expenditures.",
      "code": "# Enterprise SEM Auction & Technical SEO Engine Simulator\ndef run_unified_search_operations_engine():\n    # 1. Paid Search Auction Modeling\n    bidders = [\n        {'name': 'Enterprise Inc', 'bid': 18.50, 'qs': 9},\n        {'name': 'Rival Tech', 'bid': 25.00, 'qs': 6},\n        {'name': 'Challenger App', 'bid': 22.00, 'qs': 5}\n    ]\n    \n    for b in bidders:\n        b['rank'] = round(b['bid'] * b['qs'], 2)\n        \n    ranked = sorted(bidders, key=lambda x: x['rank'], reverse=True)\n    for idx, b in enumerate(ranked):\n        b['pos'] = idx + 1\n        if idx < len(ranked) - 1:\n            next_rank = ranked[idx + 1]['rank']\n            cpc = (next_rank / b['qs']) + 0.01\n        else:\n            cpc = (b['rank'] * 0.75) / b['qs']\n        b['cpc'] = round(min(b['bid'], cpc), 2)\n        \n    # 2. Technical SEO Core Web Vitals & Crawl Health\n    cwv_telemetry = {\n        'lcp_seconds': 1.85, # Standard <= 2.5s\n        'inp_ms': 140.0,     # Standard <= 200ms\n        'cls_score': 0.04,   # Standard <= 0.1\n        'ttfb_ms': 190.0,    # Standard <= 400ms\n        'jsonld_schema_valid': True,\n        'canonical_coverage_pct': 99.2\n    }\n    \n    cwv_passed = (\n        cwv_telemetry['lcp_seconds'] <= 2.5 and\n        cwv_telemetry['inp_ms'] <= 200.0 and\n        cwv_telemetry['cls_score'] <= 0.1 and\n        cwv_telemetry['ttfb_ms'] <= 400.0 and\n        cwv_telemetry['jsonld_schema_valid']\n    )\n    \n    print(\"=== ENTERPRISE SEARCH MARKETING PERFORMANCE REPORT ===\")\n    print(f\"Auction Winner: [{ranked[0]['name']}] -> Position #{ranked[0]['pos']}\")\n    print(f\"  Bid: ${ranked[0]['bid']:.2f} | Quality Score: {ranked[0]['qs']}/10 | Ad Rank: {ranked[0]['rank']}\")\n    print(f\"  Realized Actual CPC: ${ranked[0]['cpc']:.2f} (Savings: ${ranked[0]['bid'] - ranked[0]['cpc']:.2f} per click)\\n\")\n    \n    print(\"=== TECHNICAL SEO CORE WEB VITALS TELEMETRY ===\")\n    print(f\"Largest Contentful Paint (LCP): {cwv_telemetry['lcp_seconds']}s [PASS]\")\n    print(f\"Interaction to Next Paint (INP): {cwv_telemetry['inp_ms']}ms [PASS]\")\n    print(f\"Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS): {cwv_telemetry['cls_score']} [PASS]\")\n    print(f\"Server Time to First Byte (TTFB): {cwv_telemetry['ttfb_ms']}ms [PASS]\")\n    print(f\"Technical CWV Certification Status: {'VERIFIED_ALGORITHMIC_BOOST' if cwv_passed else 'FAIL_REMEDIATE_PERFORMANCE'}\")\n\nrun_unified_search_operations_engine()\n",
      "output": "=== ENTERPRISE SEARCH MARKETING PERFORMANCE REPORT ===\nAuction Winner: [Enterprise Inc] -> Position #1\n  Bid: $18.50 | Quality Score: 9/10 | Ad Rank: 166.5\n  Realized Actual CPC: $16.68 (Savings: $1.82 per click)\n\n=== TECHNICAL SEO CORE WEB VITALS TELEMETRY ===\nLargest Contentful Paint (LCP): 1.85s [PASS]\nInteraction to Next Paint (INP): 140.0ms [PASS]\nCumulative Layout Shift (CLS): 0.04 [PASS]\nServer Time to First Byte (TTFB): 190.0ms [PASS]\nTechnical CWV Certification Status: VERIFIED_ALGORITHMIC_BOOST",
      "tryIt": "Increase lcp_seconds to 3.8s to simulate bloated JavaScript assets and verify that technical CWV certification status changes to FAIL_REMEDIATE_PERFORMANCE.",
