      "example": "Gymshark scaling into a $1.3 billion fitness apparel powerhouse by allocating 100% of its early marketing capital into a fleet of micro and mid-tier fitness athletes on Instagram and YouTube, giving them long-term apparel sponsorships and affiliate discount codes, driving unprecedented brand loyalty and lower acquisition costs.",
      "code": "# Enterprise Viral Loop & Influencer Growth Engine Simulator\ndef run_viral_and_influencer_simulator():\n    # 1. Viral Loop Simulation (Initial Cohort: 5,000 users)\n    initial_users = 5000\n    k_subcritical = 0.82\n    k_supercritical = 1.28\n    cycles = 4\n    \n    sub_total = initial_users\n    curr_sub = initial_users\n    super_total = initial_users\n    curr_super = initial_users\n    \n    for _ in range(cycles):\n        curr_sub *= k_subcritical\n        sub_total += curr_sub\n        curr_super *= k_supercritical\n        super_total += curr_super\n        \n    # 2. Influencer Portfolio Comparison ($100k Budget)\n    ltv_usd = 150.0\n    \n    # Strategy A: 2 Celebrity Megastars ($50k each)\n    celeb_spend = 100000.0\n    celeb_views = 2000000\n    celeb_conversions = celeb_views * 0.012 * 0.015 # 1.2% CTR, 1.5% CVR\n    celeb_cpa = celeb_spend / celeb_conversions if celeb_conversions > 0 else 999.0\n    celeb_roas = (celeb_conversions * ltv_usd) / celeb_spend\n    \n    # Strategy B: 100 Micro-Influencers ($1,000 each)\n    micro_spend = 100000.0\n    micro_views = 3200000\n    micro_conversions = micro_views * 0.035 * 0.040 # 3.5% CTR, 4.0% CVR\n    micro_cpa = micro_spend / micro_conversions if micro_conversions > 0 else 999.0\n    micro_roas = (micro_conversions * ltv_usd) / micro_spend\n    \n    print(\"=== VIRAL LOOP 4-CYCLE EXPANSION TELEMETRY ===\")\n    print(f\"Initial Cohort: {initial_users:,} Users\")\n    print(f\"Sub-Critical (K=0.82):  {sub_total:,.0f} Total Users (Decayed to Zero Drift)\")\n    print(f\"Super-Critical (K=1.28): {super_total:,.0f} Total Users (Self-Sustaining Exponential)\\n\")\n    \n    print(\"=== INFLUENCER $100K CAPITAL ALLOCATION AUDIT ===\")\n    print(f\"Celebrity Strategy: Acquired {celeb_conversions:,.0f} Users | eCPA: ${celeb_cpa:.2f} | ROAS: {celeb_roas:.2f}x\")\n    print(f\"Micro-Fleet Strategy: Acquired {micro_conversions:,.0f} Users | eCPA: ${micro_cpa:.2f} | ROAS: {micro_roas:.2f}x\")\n    print(f\"Performance Multiplier: Micro-Fleet generated {micro_conversions / celeb_conversions:.1f}x more customers at {((celeb_cpa - micro_cpa) / celeb_cpa) * 100.0:.1f}% lower CPA!\")\n\nrun_viral_and_influencer_simulator()\n",
      "output": "=== VIRAL LOOP 4-CYCLE EXPANSION TELEMETRY ===\nInitial Cohort: 5,000 Users\nSub-Critical (K=0.82):  17,479 Total Users (Decayed to Zero Drift)\nSuper-Critical (K=1.28): 43,500 Total Users (Self-Sustaining Exponential)\n\n=== INFLUENCER $100K CAPITAL ALLOCATION AUDIT ===\nCelebrity Strategy: Acquired 360 Users | eCPA: $277.78 | ROAS: 0.54x\nMicro-Fleet Strategy: Acquired 4,480 Users | eCPA: $22.32 | ROAS: 6.72x\nPerformance Multiplier: Micro-Fleet generated 12.4x more customers at 92.0% lower CPA!",
