        "answer": 0,
        "why": "Scaling acquisition while churn is high creates a leaky bucket failure, rapidly destroying capital without building persistent enterprise value.",
        "answerIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Scaling acquisition while churn is high creates a leaky bucket failure, rapidly destroying capital without building persistent enterprise value."
