      "example": "Procter & Gamble's algorithmic growth engine managing 65 iconic global brands (Tide, Pampers, Gillette) through a unified corporate marketing operating system that balances billions in brand advertising with precision digital programmatic media, generating consistent multi-decade shareholder returns.",
      "code": "# Milestone 6 Grand Final Capstone: Autonomous CMO Enterprise Growth Engine\ndef run_autonomous_cmo_growth_os():\n    # Baseline Enterprise Corporate Parameters\n    starting_annual_revenue_usd = 150000000.0\n    annual_marketing_budget_usd = 25000000.0\n    gross_margin_pct = 68.0\n    \n    # Pillar 1: Strategic Budget Allocation (60% Brand Demand Creation, 40% Performance Capture)\n    brand_creation_spend = annual_marketing_budget_usd * 0.60\n    performance_capture_spend = annual_marketing_budget_usd * 0.40\n    \n    # Pillar 2: Demand Generation & Customer Acquisition\n    # Performance capture generates immediate conversions at $160 CAC\n    direct_performance_customers = performance_capture_spend / 160.0\n    # Brand creation generates long-term organic halo conversions (1.5x multiplier)\n    organic_brand_halo_customers = (brand_creation_spend / 220.0) * 1.50\n    total_new_customers_acquired = direct_performance_customers + organic_brand_halo_customers\n    \n    blended_cac_usd = annual_marketing_budget_usd / total_new_customers_acquired\n    \n    # Pillar 3: Customer Retention & LTV Dynamics\n    average_order_value_usd = 180.0\n    annual_purchase_frequency = 4.2\n    annual_spend_per_customer_usd = average_order_value_usd * annual_purchase_frequency # $756/yr\n    \n    # 3-Year Customer Lifetime Value (assuming 78% annual retention and 68% gross margin)\n    clv_3yr_gross_profit_usd = (annual_spend_per_customer_usd * (gross_margin_pct / 100.0)) * (1.0 + 0.78 + (0.78 ** 2))\n    clv_to_cac_ratio = clv_3yr_gross_profit_usd / blended_cac_usd\n    \n    # Pillar 4: Revenue Expansion & Cross-Border Contribution\n    incremental_domestic_revenue = total_new_customers_acquired * annual_spend_per_customer_usd\n    cross_border_expansion_revenue = incremental_domestic_revenue * 0.35 # 35% international lift\n    total_new_revenue_generated = incremental_domestic_revenue + cross_border_expansion_revenue\n    \n    final_annual_revenue_usd = starting_annual_revenue_usd + total_new_revenue_generated\n    annual_revenue_growth_pct = (total_new_revenue_generated / starting_annual_revenue_usd) * 100.0\n    \n    # Pillar 5: Return on Marketing Investment (ROMI) & Cash Payback\n    incremental_gross_profit = total_new_revenue_generated * (gross_margin_pct / 100.0)\n    net_marketing_profit = incremental_gross_profit - annual_marketing_budget_usd\n    romi_pct = (net_marketing_profit / annual_marketing_budget_usd) * 100.0\n    payback_months = (blended_cac_usd / (annual_spend_per_customer_usd * (gross_margin_pct / 100.0))) * 12.0\n    \n    # Pillar 6: Boardroom Enterprise Valuation Multiple\n    ev_multiple = 5.5 # Base premium multiple\n    enterprise_value_usd = final_annual_revenue_usd * ev_multiple\n    \n    print(\"=====================================================================\")\n    print(\"  AUTONOMOUS CMO ENTERPRISE GROWTH OPERATING SYSTEM (MOS) REPORT\")\n    print(\"=====================================================================\\n\")\n    print(\"--- 1. CAPITAL ALLOCATION & DEMAND CREATION ---\")\n    print(f\"Total Marketing Capital Deployed: ${annual_marketing_budget_usd:,.2f}\")\n    print(f\"  Brand Building (Demand Creation - 60%):    ${brand_creation_spend:,.2f}\")\n    print(f\"  Performance Ads (Demand Capture - 40%):   ${performance_capture_spend:,.2f}\\n\")\n    \n    print(\"--- 2. CUSTOMER ACQUISITION & UNIT ECONOMICS ---\")\n    print(f\"Total New Customers Acquired: {total_new_customers_acquired:,.0f}\")\n    print(f\"Blended Customer Acquisition Cost (CAC): ${blended_cac_usd:.2f}\")\n    print(f\"3-Year Customer Lifetime Value (CLV): ${clv_3yr_gross_profit_usd:.2f}\")\n    print(f\"CLV:CAC Ratio: {clv_to_cac_ratio:.2f}x [HURDLE PASS: >= 3.5x]\")\n    print(f\"Cash Payback Period: {payback_months:.1f} Months [HURDLE PASS: <= 12m]\\n\")\n    \n    print(\"--- 3. ENTERPRISE REVENUE EXPANSION & P&L IMPACT ---\")\n    print(f\"Baseline Enterprise Revenue: ${starting_annual_revenue_usd:,.2f}\")\n    print(f\"New Revenue Generated: ${total_new_revenue_generated:,.2f} (+{annual_revenue_growth_pct:.1f}% Growth)\")\n    print(f\"Final Consolidated Annual Revenue: ${final_annual_revenue_usd:,.2f}\")\n    print(f\"Net Marketing Profit Added: ${net_marketing_profit:,.2f}\")\n    print(f\"Return on Marketing Investment (ROMI): {romi_pct:.1f}%\\n\")\n    \n    print(\"--- 4. BOARD OF DIRECTORS SHAREHOLDER VALUE CREATION ---\")\n    print(f\"Enterprise Valuation Multiple: {ev_multiple}x Consolidated Revenue\")\n    print(f\"Final Enterprise Valuation: ${enterprise_value_usd:,.2f}\")\n    print(f\"Net Shareholder Value Created: ${enterprise_value_usd - (starting_annual_revenue_usd * 4.0):,.2f}\")\n    print(\"Boardroom Verdict: [APPROVED_UNANIMOUSLY_CHIEF_MARKETING_OFFICER_FLAGSHIP]\")\n\nrun_autonomous_cmo_growth_os()\n",
      "output": "=====================================================================\n  AUTONOMOUS CMO ENTERPRISE GROWTH OPERATING SYSTEM (MOS) REPORT\n=====================================================================\n\n--- 1. CAPITAL ALLOCATION & DEMAND CREATION ---\nTotal Marketing Capital Deployed: $25,000,000.00\n  Brand Building (Demand Creation - 60%):    $15,000,000.00\n  Performance Ads (Demand Capture - 40%):   $10,000,000.00\n\n--- 2. CUSTOMER ACQUISITION & UNIT ECONOMICS ---\nTotal New Customers Acquired: 164,773\nBlended Customer Acquisition Cost (CAC): $151.72\n3-Year Customer Lifetime Value (CLV): $1227.83\nCLV:CAC Ratio: 8.09x [HURDLE PASS: >= 3.5x]\nCash Payback Period: 3.5 Months [HURDLE PASS: <= 12m]\n\n--- 3. ENTERPRISE REVENUE EXPANSION & P&L IMPACT ---\nBaseline Enterprise Revenue: $150,000,000.00\nNew Revenue Generated: $168,167,045.45 (+112.1% Growth)\nFinal Consolidated Annual Revenue: $318,167,045.45\nNet Marketing Profit Added: $89,353,590.91\nReturn on Marketing Investment (ROMI): 357.4%\n\n--- 4. BOARD OF DIRECTORS SHAREHOLDER VALUE CREATION ---\nEnterprise Valuation Multiple: 5.5x Consolidated Revenue\nFinal Enterprise Valuation: $1,749,918,750.00\nNet Shareholder Value Created: $1,149,918,750.00\nBoardroom Verdict: [APPROVED_UNANIMOUSLY_CHIEF_MARKETING_OFFICER_FLAGSHIP]",
