      "example": "When Procter & Gamble rationalized its sprawling global portfolio in 2014, it divested over one hundred underperforming brands (including CoverGirl and Clairol) to focus exclusively on sixty-five core strategic assets. The rationalization eliminated massive operational drag, sparked double-digit margin expansion, and generated historic shareholder returns.",
      "code": "def execute_acb_portfolio_rationalization(\n    initial_brand_count: int,\n    flagship_pre_revenue_m: float,\n    flagship_margin_pct: float,\n    cannibal_flanker_revenue_m: float,\n    cannibal_flanker_margin_pct: float,\n    cannibalization_rate: float,\n    redundant_overhead_per_brand_m: float,\n    divestiture_proceeds_m: float\n) -> dict:\n    # Financial impact of Lumina vs Verdant cannibalization\n    flagship_margin_dollar = flagship_pre_revenue_m * flagship_margin_pct\n    flanker_margin_dollar = cannibal_flanker_revenue_m * cannibal_flanker_margin_pct\n    \n    cannibalized_revenue = cannibal_flanker_revenue_m * cannibalization_rate\n    lost_flagship_margin = cannibalized_revenue * flagship_margin_pct\n    net_flanker_contribution = flanker_margin_dollar - lost_flagship_margin\n    \n    # Post-Rationalization Portfolio Reconstruction\n    # Folding flanker into flagship restores 85% of cannibalized volume at flagship margin\n    restored_flagship_revenue = flagship_pre_revenue_m + (cannibalized_revenue * 0.85)\n    post_flagship_margin = restored_flagship_revenue * flagship_margin_pct\n    \n    # Overhead savings from eliminating redundant brands (pruning 16 brands down to 12)\n    brands_pruned = initial_brand_count - 12\n    annual_overhead_savings = brands_pruned * redundant_overhead_per_brand_m\n    \n    total_annual_profit_uplift = (post_flagship_margin - flagship_margin_dollar) + annual_overhead_savings - net_flanker_contribution\n    \n    return {\n        'pre_rationalization_net_flanker_impact_m': round(net_flanker_contribution, 2),\n        'lost_flagship_margin_m': round(lost_flagship_margin, 2),\n        'brands_pruned_count': brands_pruned,\n        'retained_focused_brands': 12,\n        'annual_overhead_savings_m': round(annual_overhead_savings, 2),\n        'post_rationalization_flagship_revenue_m': round(restored_flagship_revenue, 2),\n        'total_annual_profit_uplift_m': round(total_annual_profit_uplift, 2),\n        'one_time_divestiture_liquidity_m': round(divestiture_proceeds_m, 2)\n    }\n\n# Simulation of Phase 1 ACB Portfolio Restructuring\np1 = execute_acb_portfolio_rationalization(\n    initial_brand_count=28,\n    flagship_pre_revenue_m=650.0,\n    flagship_margin_pct=0.42,\n    cannibal_flanker_revenue_m=180.0,\n    cannibal_flanker_margin_pct=0.24,\n    cannibalization_rate=0.65,\n    redundant_overhead_per_brand_m=3.0,\n    divestiture_proceeds_m=140.0\n)\n\nprint(f\"Pre-Turnaround Cannibalization Drain: ${p1['lost_flagship_margin_m']}M lost from flagship!\")\nprint(f\"Net Flanker True Margin Contribution: ${p1['pre_rationalization_net_flanker_impact_m']}M\")\nprint(f\"Brands Pruned: {p1['brands_pruned_count']} | Retained Core Strategic Brands: {p1['retained_focused_brands']}\")\nprint(f\"Annual SG&A Overhead Savings: ${p1['annual_overhead_savings_m']}M\")\nprint(f\"Restored Flagship Revenue: ${p1['post_rationalization_flagship_revenue_m']}M\")\nprint(f\"Total Net Annual Operating Profit Uplift: ${p1['total_annual_profit_uplift_m']}M\")\nprint(f\"One-Time Non-Dilutive Capital Unlocked: ${p1['one_time_divestiture_liquidity_m']}M\")",
