  "recap": "Welcome to the Milestone 8 Capstone. Over Days 36 through 39, we mastered the core engines of market execution: Integrated Marketing Communications (IMC), omnichannel distribution logistics, gray market parallel importation defense, strategic services marketing, SERVQUAL gap modeling, service blueprinting, and global market entry strategy. Today, you assume the role of Chief Global Commercial Officer (CGCO) at AuraHealth Technologies (AHT) to lead the worldwide launch of the AuraVital Pro biometric healthcare ecosystem, integrating every analytical and governance discipline into an audit-proof commercial triumph.",
