  "recap": "Welcome to Day 44 of Strategic Marketing & Brand Systems. Having mastered cohort retention economics, dynamic subscription pricing, and B2B Account-Based Marketing on Days 41 through 43, we now examine the most critical defensive capability in the modern CMO arsenal: Brand Crisis Management and Reputational Capital Preservation. In an era of viral social algorithms and rapid regulatory intervention, brand trust built over decades can evaporate in hours."
