      "code": "def execute_black_friday_crisis_war_room(\n    outage_duration_hours: float,\n    affected_clients_count: int,\n    estimated_client_downtime_loss_usd: float,\n    restitution_fund_allocation_usd: float,\n    baseline_churn_risk_pct: float,\n    holding_statement_minutes_elapsed: int\n) -> dict:\n    # Audit Golden Hour Adherence\n    adhered_to_golden_hour = holding_statement_minutes_elapsed <= 60\n    \n    # Coombs SCCT Posture Evaluation: Preventable Cluster Outage\n    scct_posture = 'FULL_REBUILD_AND_STRUCTURAL_RESTITUTION'\n    \n    # Statutory Regulatory Disclosures Triggered\n    sec_8k_required = True  # Item 1.05 Material Outage\n    sec_8k_deadline_days = 4\n    gdpr_notification_hours = 72\n    \n    # Churn Risk Mitigation Model\n    # If Golden Hour Met + Rebuild Posture + $50M Fund -> Churn risk reduces by 80%\n    mitigation_factor = 0.20 if (adhered_to_golden_hour and restitution_fund_allocation_usd >= 50000000.0) else 0.75\n    residual_churn_risk_pct = round(baseline_churn_risk_pct * mitigation_factor, 1)\n    \n    preserved_arr_usd = (affected_clients_count * 228100.0) * (1.0 - (residual_churn_risk_pct / 100.0))\n    at_risk_arr_usd = (affected_clients_count * 228100.0) * (baseline_churn_risk_pct / 100.0)\n    salvaged_arr_usd = at_risk_arr_usd - ((affected_clients_count * 228100.0) * (residual_churn_risk_pct / 100.0))\n    \n    return {\n        'outage_hours': outage_duration_hours,\n        'golden_hour_adherence': adhered_to_golden_hour,\n        'scct_response_posture': scct_posture,\n        'statutory_filings': {\n            'sec_form_8k_item_1_05': f\"Mandatory filing within {sec_8k_deadline_days} business days\",\n            'eu_gdpr_article_33': f\"Mandatory notification within {gdpr_notification_hours} hours\"\n        },\n        'restitution_fund_usd': restitution_fund_allocation_usd,\n        'baseline_churn_risk_pct': baseline_churn_risk_pct,\n        'residual_churn_risk_pct': residual_churn_risk_pct,\n        'preserved_client_arr_usd': round(preserved_arr_usd, 2),\n        'salvaged_client_arr_usd': round(salvaged_arr_usd, 2)\n    }\n\n# Phase 4 War Room Simulation: ApexLogix Black Friday Zero-Day Event\nwar_room_audit = execute_black_friday_crisis_war_room(\n    outage_duration_hours=18.0,\n    affected_clients_count=450,\n    estimated_client_downtime_loss_usd=250000000.0,\n    restitution_fund_allocation_usd=50000000.0,\n    baseline_churn_risk_pct=45.0,  # 45% of clients threatened to leave\n    holding_statement_minutes_elapsed=32\n)\n\nprint(\"=== ApexLogix PR War Room Crisis Execution Audit ===\")\nprint(f\"Incident: 18-Hour Global Cloud Outage on Black Friday ({war_room_audit['outage_hours']} hrs)\")\nprint(f\"Golden Hour Adherence: {war_room_audit['golden_hour_adherence']} (Statement Issued at 32 mins)\")\nprint(f\"Coombs SCCT Posture: {war_room_audit['scct_response_posture']}\")\nprint(f\"Restitution Fund Deployed: ${war_room_audit['restitution_fund_usd']:,.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Client Churn Risk: {war_room_audit['baseline_churn_risk_pct']}% -> Slashed to {war_room_audit['residual_churn_risk_pct']}%\")\nprint(f\"Preserved Enterprise ARR: ${war_room_audit['preserved_client_arr_usd']:,.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Salvaged At-Risk ARR: ${war_room_audit['salvaged_client_arr_usd']:,.2f}\")\nprint(\"Statutory Disclosures: SEC 8-K (4 Days) & GDPR Article 33 (72 Hours) Approved.\")",
      "output": "=== ApexLogix PR War Room Crisis Execution Audit ===\nIncident: 18-Hour Global Cloud Outage on Black Friday (18.0 hrs)\nGolden Hour Adherence: True (Statement Issued at 32 mins)\nCoombs SCCT Posture: FULL_REBUILD_AND_STRUCTURAL_RESTITUTION\nRestitution Fund Deployed: $50,000,000.00\nClient Churn Risk: 45.0% -> Slashed to 9.0%\nPreserved Enterprise ARR: $93,406,950.00\nSalvaged At-Risk ARR: $36,952,200.00\nStatutory Disclosures: SEC 8-K (4 Days) & GDPR Article 33 (72 Hours) Approved.",
