      "example": "VerdantCore's Phase 3 Bayesian MMM optimization reallocated $32M across their $180M budget. The optimizer equalized portfolio marginal ROAS at $1.12 per dollar, unlocking $46.8M in incremental top-line revenue (+7.2% lift) and saving $14M in saturated search waste without altering the aggregate budget envelope.",
      "code": "def execute_capstone_phase3_bayesian_mmm(\n    total_budget_usd: float = 180000000.0,\n    initial_revenue_usd: float = 248400000.0,\n    reallocated_capital_usd: float = 32000000.0,\n    projected_revenue_lift_usd: float = 46800000.0,\n    mcmc_r_hat: float = 1.01,\n    harmonized_shadow_price_lambda: float = 1.12\n) -> dict:\n    # Milestone 12 Capstone Phase 3: Econometric Bayesian MMM & KKT Optimization\n    optimized_total_revenue = initial_revenue_usd + projected_revenue_lift_usd\n    initial_blended_roas = initial_revenue_usd / total_budget_usd\n    optimized_blended_roas = optimized_total_revenue / total_budget_usd\n    \n    return {\n        'phase': 'Phase 3: Econometric Bayesian MMM & KKT Optimization',\n        'total_marketing_budget_usd': total_budget_usd,\n        'rebalanced_capital_usd': reallocated_capital_usd,\n        'initial_portfolio_revenue_usd': initial_revenue_usd,\n        'optimized_portfolio_revenue_usd': optimized_total_revenue,\n        'net_revenue_expansion_usd': projected_revenue_lift_usd,\n        'blended_roas_lift': f\"{initial_blended_roas:.2f}x -> {optimized_blended_roas:.2f}x\",\n        'equimarginal_shadow_price_lambda': harmonized_shadow_price_lambda,\n        'mcmc_convergence_certified': mcmc_r_hat <= 1.05\n    }\n\np3_out = execute_capstone_phase3_bayesian_mmm()\nprint(\"=== Milestone 12 Capstone Phase 3: Econometric Bayesian MMM Engine ===\")\nprint(f\"Annual Marketing Budget:       ${p3_out['total_marketing_budget_usd']:,.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Capital Reallocated via KKT:   ${p3_out['rebalanced_capital_usd']:,.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Initial Portfolio Revenue:     ${p3_out['initial_portfolio_revenue_usd']:,.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Optimized Portfolio Revenue:   ${p3_out['optimized_portfolio_revenue_usd']:,.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Free Top-Line Expansion:       +${p3_out['net_revenue_expansion_usd']:,.2f} (+18.8% Gain)\")\nprint(f\"Blended Portfolio ROAS Shift:  {p3_out['blended_roas_lift']}\")\nprint(f\"Harmonized Marginal mROAS:     ${p3_out['equimarginal_shadow_price_lambda']} Return per Next Dollar\")\nprint(f\"MCMC Convergence Status:       {p3_out['mcmc_convergence_certified']} (R-hat = 1.01)\")",
